  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Institutional Linkages</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Pacific Institutional Linkages Initiative is to strengthen personal and institutional linkages between Australia and Pacific islands countries. The main activity, the Pacific Institutional Linkages Program aims to support Pacific governments in their efforts to tackle identified and discrete governance issues relating to economic and public financial management and public sector capability and performance.</narrative>
  </description>
